WEBVTT

00:05:59.146 --> 00:06:00.689
as fast as you can,

00:06:00.689 --> 00:06:02.650
for as long as you can.

00:06:02.691 --> 00:06:04.610
And don't worry."

00:06:06.612 --> 00:06:08.030
"Don't worry."

00:06:08.906 --> 00:06:11.450
It sounds simple, and it is,

00:06:11.492 --> 00:06:13.911
but I guess I didn't really
believe it was possible

00:06:13.911 --> 00:06:15.955
until it came from somebody
that I trusted.

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:20.251
Around the same time, I had a teammate
named Blake Costanzo.

00:06:20.292 --> 00:06:23.838
Blake was a linebacker
who was a little nuts.

00:06:24.839 --> 00:06:25.965
Before games,

00:06:26.006 --> 00:06:29.427
he would run around the locker room
and he would get in everybody's face

00:06:29.427 --> 00:06:30.636
and he'd ask,